      <title>Sea salt plays key role in Metro Manila air pollution</title>
      <link>https://www.sunstar.com.ph/davao/sea-salt-plays-key-rolein-metro-manila-air-pollution</link>
      <description>A new study by Ateneo-Manila Observatory and U. of Arizona found that sea salt particles chemically react with city pollution, contributing to Metro Manila air quality. The COVID-19 lockdown showed reduced pollution led to less chloride depletion of airborne sea salt components.</description>
